<title>SRI LANKA: S.LANKA OXYGEN SAYS 6-MONTH NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>S.LANKA OXYGEN SAYS 6-MONTH NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>	 (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	   22.90    vs	  25.91</p>
<p>    Turnover	    250.94    vs	 221.32</p>
<p>    Tax provision	13.00    vs	  12.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Ceylon Oxygen Ltd, Sri Lanka's main producer of industrial and medical gases, is a unit of Norway's Norsk Hydro ASA.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
